# Transaction History date order (accounting sandbox)

## Invariant

**Transaction History (P&L period)** lists every bank-statement row **and** Add Cash Expense whose date sits in the banner From/To — not only the last uploaded PDF. Q4 upload must not hide Dec–Mar cash or earlier statements when the period is 7 Dec–29 Jun.

Same list is chronological (earliest date first). Cash expenses must not be dumped at the end of the bank block.

## Do

- Sort with `sortTransactionsChronologically` from `lib/dashboard/sort-transactions.ts` (ISO dates via `toIsoDateString`).
- Merge cash into statement-scoped History via `mergeManualCashExpenses` (already sorts).
- For **P&L period**, use `filterBusinessLedgerForPeriod` / `dashboardTransactions` (full ledger ∩ banner).
- Same calendar day: keep bank lines in statement order, then cash/manual.

## Do not

- Append `source: 'manual'` / `cash_*` rows after all bank rows without sorting.
- Sort on raw display strings (`DD/MM/YYYY`) — always normalise to ISO first.
- Assume History “statement” scope is bank-only forever — Cash Expense belongs in the same date-ordered view as P&L.
